      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The artificial intelligence and machine learning (AI/ML) track primarily focuses on three core layers of this stack: AI chips , models, training, and inference , and agent development and management , with security, governance, and cost optimization woven throughout.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/the-attendees-guide-to-the-aws-reinvent-2026-ai-ml-track/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T21:05:59.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-11-12T18:15:14.163Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "These sessions cover the core AWS AI services together: Amazon Bedrock, Amazon SageMaker AI, Amazon Bedrock AgentCore, and the AI chips that they run on.",
