      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "AWS gives you several places to run them: AWS Regions , AWS Local Zones , AWS Dedicated Local Zones , AWS AI Factories , and AWS Outposts .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/the-attendees-guide-to-the-aws-reinvent-2026-ai-ml-track/",
